      "analysis_source": "llm-per-reviewer",
      "patch_summary": "This patch series adds selftests to cover the contractual behaviors of MADV_COLD and MADV_PAGEOUT, which share a page-table walker in mm/madvise.c. The tests ensure that these hints behave correctly for various scenarios, including zero-length ranges, huge PMDs, shared memory, and file ownership. The patches also include checks for swap/eviction capabilities and skip relevant tests if they are not available. The selftests cover 24 different cases and have been run on a virtme-ng guest with three consecutive passes without any skips or warnings."
